<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Ndwewe Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Akaaebulania</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lihamba kwa AKAAEBULANIA</para>
  <para style="toc2">Akaaebulania</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ebu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">AKAAEBULANIA</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabho kya Akaaebulania ndo lihamba lya kuyonjokeha mwoyo liibhoneha bhula Yesu pakahotola kutwihiliha umoo umbuye ghwa Lilaghano lya Makachu. Lihamba alyo lityekwa handa malandamiho. Mu kitabho aki kubhegha na milando ya hipalamande kuchweha sitini hya hitohe ya Lilaghano lya Makachu kupitingana mbinda mabhoko sita yiibhoneha bhula Yesu Pakatwihilihhite lihengo lya Ndundame Nkulu ghwa Akaayahudi. Kya habhu kitabhu kikilinga kubhayonjokeha mwoyo Akaayahudi bhaabheghite Akilisito. Lihamba kwa Akaaebulania lingubhoneha bhula Yesu pakatwihilikite malaghilo ngati andundame akotoke kubhakukuha bhandu kubhuha nyambi ya kuyocha. Yesu kakibhegha nyambi ya ulemwa ghwoha, na ikitendeka mala yimu kwa kya manjubha ghoha. Bhandu bhanakuhyubhalila Kilisito bha manjubha agha, Kangi mu manjubha agha Akaakilisto bhaahotola kuyonjokehwa mwoyo mu lihamba kwa Akaaebulania ngati aghendelele kuntughila Yesu Kilisito kiyaha ywombe kangututangatila ngauhotolo kwa twenga kunhyubhalila Chapanga, na kangi kughendelela kuubhika udumbilo ghwetu mu mwene (Akaaebulania12:2).</para>
  <para style="ip">Kabhone ywakamanya ndo ghani ywakatyekite Kitabho kya Akaaebulania, peni asomi bhangulongela kukita pangi Nndumila Paulo,ebu Luka ebu Balinaba ndo yummoo ywabhe kakityeka lihamba ali. Kangi yingumanyikwa ng'obhe linjubha lya kutyekwa kitabho aki peni atangalo anguhwacha kukita lityekwa kukali na ngungwa ya Mbinda mabhoko saba mbole ya kubhelekwa Yesu. Mu ngungwa ayo kitami kya Yelusalemu kikihanjaghanwa na ntyeka ghwa lihamba ali kangutyeka ya kya Yelusalemu handa yikali na kuhanjanganwa. Kitabhu aki kya Akaaebulania kikityekwa ku kitami kya Loma. (Akaaebulania 13:24) na pangi kikikwila mu mamoo ya mangwemuko gha bhandu bhaanhyubhalilite Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghaabheghite</para>
  <para style="io1">Ntyeka kangubhoneha kukita Yesu ndo nkulu kupitingana ambuye na andumitumi bha kunani kwa Chapanga, Akaaebulania 1:1—4:13.</para>
  <para style="io1">Mbole kangughendelela kubhoneha kukita Yesu mwakabheghite Nkulu kupitingana andundame bhaatenda undundame mu Kitutubhi kya Chapanga akwo Yelusalemu Akaaebulania 4:14—7:28.</para>
  <para style="io1">Kangi undumila ghwa Yesu ndo ghwa maha kupitingana ghula ghwa lilaghano lya makachu lyene Chapanga kakitenda na bhandu bhake kwa malaghilo ghakanpeghite Musa, Akaaebulania 8:1—10:31.</para>
  <para style="io1">Mbole ya kulubhulila kukita Yesu ndo nkulu mu njila yohele, ntyeka kangubhuha mamoo malaghilo kwa njila ya mandendelo Akaaebulania10:32—13:17.</para>
  <para style="io1">Kuuhiko ntyeka kanguyomolela lihamba kwa malagho gha kubhayonjokeha mwoyo na kuajambua, Akaaebulania10—13:18-25.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga kangulongela na bhandu kwa njila ya Mwana ghwake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Pamakachu pala Chapanga kakilongela patangalo na aghohi bhetu mu njila nhanganganiko kukindila kwa ambuye, <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />peni mu manjubha agha gha uhiko, Chapanga kangulongela na twenga kukindila Mwana ghwake. Chapanga kwa njila ya ywombe kakighubhumba unnima na kakinpegha hilibhi hyoha kahitabhale. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Ywombe ndo ung'anyimo ghwa ukulu ghwa Chapanga na kangubhoneha bhula Chapanga pakabheghite. Kanguyambuha hilibhi yoha himamalitane papamu handa payibheghite kwa lilagho lyake liibheghite na makakala. Mbole ya kubhayoha bhandu na kubhabhuhila ulemwa, kakighenda katama kunani mu mbande ya nnilo ya ukulu ghwa Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulu ghwa Mwana ghwa Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Mwana ghwa Chapanga kakitendekwa nkulu kupitingana Andumitumi bha kunani kwa Chapanga, na lihina lyake lyakapeghitwe na Chapanga ndo likulu muno kupitingana gha abho andumitumi. <verse eid="HEB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Kiyaha Chapanga kakinng'ombela ng'obhe nga nndumitumi ghwake ywohele ghwa kunani kukita,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Ghwenga ndo Mwana ghwangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">nenga lelo megha Tate ghwako!”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Kangi kakinng'ombela ng'obhe nga nndumitumi ghwake yumu ghwa kunani kukita,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Nenga ndabhegha Tate ghwake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">na ywombe katabhegha Mwana ghwangu.”<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Peni Chapanga pakabheghite kangunlaghila mwana ghwake ghwa ulongohi mu nnima ndo kakilongela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">“Andumitumi bhoha bha kunani yinguakwiliha kuntundamila.”<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Peni kya kualinga andumitumi bhake bha kunani kakilongela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">“Chapanga nungubhaghalambula andumitumi bhangu bha kunani abheghe likusi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">Na andumila bhake nungubhaghalambula abheghe mibhale ya mwoto.”<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Peni kwa kya Mwana ghwake, Chapanga kakilongela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">“Ghubhutwa ghwako ghwenga Chapanga ghwabhegha ghwa manjubha ghoha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">ghwenga ghwabhatabhala bhandu bhako muyinoghelwa.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Ghungupala kutenda ghanakunoghela na ghungulema uhakata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">Ya kya agho Chapanga, Chapanga ghwako kakuhaghula ghwenga na kughupopohela mahuta gha maha ngati ghubheghe nkulu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">na kakupegha ghwenga uhokamo na uyelelo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">kupitingana ayako bhoha.”<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Kangi kakilongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">“Ghwenga Bambo, pamakachu ghukighubhumba nnima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">na kwa mabhoko ghako ghukitendekeha kunani.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Ahyo hyoha hyahobha, peni ghwenga ghwahighala manjubha ghoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:11">Hyoha hyahakala handa mapinda.<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Ghwahibhilinga handa likama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">na hyaghalambulwa handa maghwanda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">Peni ghwenga ghwahighala handa paghubhele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">na ubhumi ghwako ghwaapela ng'obhe.”<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Bhuli Chapanga kakilongela kwa nndumitumi ghwake ywoki ghwa kunani kukita,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">“Ghutame apa mu mbande yangu ya nnilo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">mbaka panubhabhika amyanja bhako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">pahi yako handa kiteho kya kulibhatila maghulu.”<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Andumitumi bha kunani kwa Chapanga ndo aghani? ndo mihuki yiintendela lihengo Chapanga na bhalaghilwa na ywombe kuatangatila bhoha bhaapala kukingama ulopohi.<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s">Ulopohi nkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Habhu tungunoghwa kughaghungila ghala ghatughayihwite ngati ghakotoke kuhobheha. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Nhalo ghula ghwapeghitwe aghohi bhetu na andumitumi bha kunani ghukiyimihwa kukita ghwa hoto, na bhoha bhaghulemite kughutughila ebu bhaalemite kughuyitikila bhakihyatwa handa payinoghitwe. <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />Hino, twenga twahepetuka bhuli handa twaghupughana ulopohi nkulu handa aghu? Paulongohi Bambo kakiulandamiha ulopohi aghu, na bhala bhaayihwite bhakitughombela twenga kukita lilagho ali ndo lya hoto. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Naywo Chapanga kakiyimiha pakabhoneha ulopohi aghwo kukita ndo hoto kwa naho, na kwa makangacho na kwa mihabho nhanganganiko, kwa kuapegha lilumbo lya Nhuki ghwake handa pakapalite mwene.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo ywakatulongoha ku ulopoho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Chapanga kakibhapegha chepa andumitumi bhake bha kunani, makakala gha kutabhala nnima ghuupala kuhika, ghwene ndo nnima ghwatughukambuka mihalo yake. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Peni pabhegha pahala pamo Matyeko ghatyekwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">“Mundu ndo kilibhi ghani mbaka ghunhwache?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">Na anamundu ndo kilibhi ghani mbaka ghuntekule?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Ghuntenda kabheghe pahi kya mandina ya andumitumi bhako bha kunani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">Ghunhwaliha kilemba kya ukulu na uhokamo,<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />Ghubhatenda atabhale hilibhi hyoha.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Chapanga kahibhika hilibhi hyoha mu utabhala ghwetu na kahone kilibhi kiibheghite ng'obhe mu makakala ghetu. Peni mbaka hinu tungubhona ng'obhe mundu pakatabhala hilibhi hyoha. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Peni tungummona Yesu ywene kakitendwa kabheghe ndokwa kupitingana andumitumi bha kunani, ngati kwa luhungu lwa Chapanga pamandina, yikinkwiliha kuhwegha kwa kya bhandu bhoha. Hinu tungummona kahwalihwa kilemba kya ukulu na uhokamo kubhukana na mapungwo na kuhwegha kwake. <verse eid="HEB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Kiyaha yikibhegha telatela kwa Chapanga, ywakabhumbite na kuhibhika hilibhi hyoha handa payibheghite, kantende Yesu katwihilike kukindila himbamanda, ngati kabhayeghe bhana atangalo mu ukulu ghwake. Kiyaha Yesu ndo ywakaalongoha bhombe mu ulopoho ghwabhe.<verse eid="HEB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Ywombe yunakubhayoha bhandu ulemwa ghwabhe, ywombe papamu na bhala bhaayohwitwe, bhoha abhegha na Tate yumu. Ndo kiyaha kangubhona ng'obhe honi kubhakema abho alongo bhake. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />Handa pakalongelite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">“Ndabhalubhulila alongo bhangu kila kighukitendite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">Mu ngwemuko lya bhandu bha Chapanga, ndaghuyimbila luyimbo lwa kukutika.”<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Kangi kangulongela, “Ndanhyubhalila Chapanga ghwangu.” Na bhubho kangulongela, “Nenga megha apa papamu na bhana bhakambeghite Chapanga.”<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Hino, kiyaha bhana abho ndo bhandu bha mmili na mwahi, ndo Yesu naywo kakihika na mmili handa bhombe. Kakitenda naha ngati kwa njila ya kiho kyake kankanjaghane Nchipila, ywakabheghite na makakala gha kya kiho, <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />ngati kabhalekekehe bhala bhaabheghite mu ubhandwa mu ubhumi ghwabhe ghwoha kwa kubhegha na bhwaghalili ghwa kiho. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Kulyaghila ywombe kakihika ng'obhe kubhatangatila andumitumi ghwa kunani kwa Chapanga, ngati kubhatangatila ubheleko ghwa Ibulahimu. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Kwa nnando aghu, kakinoghwa kabheghe handa alongo bhake, ngati kabheghe ndundame ghwabhe nkulu ywakuhyubhalika na yunaluhungu, mu kuntendela lihengo Chapanga, ngati ulemwa ghwa bhandu bhake ghulekekehwe. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Kiyaha ywombe kikipamandwa pakang'ehitwe habhu kaahotola kubhatangatila bhala bhaang'ehwa na kupamandwa.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo nkulu kupitingana Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Hino, maalongo bhangu muuhaghulitwe na Chapanga, ngati muulilungite na lukemo lwa kunani kwa Chapanga, munhwachile muno Yesu, Nndumila na Ndundame Nkulu ghwa uhyubhalilo ghutuukambuka, <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />ywombe kakibhegha nhyubhaliko kwa ywakanhaghulite, handa Musa pakabheghite nhyubhaliko bhandu bha Isilaeli bhene ndo kitutubhi kya Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Peni Yesu kangunoghwa uhokamo nkulu kuchweha kwa Musa, kiyaha yunakuchenga kitutubhi pakapeghwa uhokamo kyanalumu kupitingana kwa kitutubhi kyene. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Kila kitutubhi kinguchengwa na mundu, peni Chapanga ndo nchenga ghwa hilibhi hyoha. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Musa kakibhegha lihoka ghwa kuhyubhalika mu bhandu bha kitutubhi kya Akaaisilaeli bhoha, na kakikambuka milando yene Chapanga katalongela kuulongolo, <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />peni Kilisito handa Mwana nhyubhaliko ywakaalongoha bhandu bha kitutubhi kya Chapanga, na twenga ndo bhandu abho mu kitutubhi kya Chapanga, Handa twaaghendelela kubhegha akangamalo na ahwadali mu milando yila yituyidumbila mbaka ku uhiko.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupumulila kwa bhandu bha Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Hinu, handa pakalongela Nhuki ghwa Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">“Handa lelo pamuliyihwa lilobhe lya Chapanga,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />nkotoke kubhegha na ngakatala, handa abhele bhenu paang'ehite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">paabheghite bhangung'eha kula kukibhala.<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />Akwo ndo aghohi bhenu bhakibhegha bhangung'eha nenga na kumbima, Chapanga kangulongela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">hata bhula mu ngungwa mbinda mabhoko ncheche bhakighabhona mandendelo ghangu ghandendite.<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Habhu ndo bhandu bhala bhakindenda nyaghabhale na nikilongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">‘Abha bhandu ndo ahokelo manjubha ghoha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">Na bhangulema kuyitikila kinikilongela.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Nikiyaghabhala na nikilapa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:11">‘Bhaayingila ng'obhe mu nnima ghwene ndabhapegha apughwe!’”<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Alongo bhangu, mu mwenga kakotoke kubhegha mundu yuna ngakatala ywangahyubhalila, na ywakalibhaghulite na Chapanga yunakulama. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Peni nnyonjokehane mwoyo mabhene kwa mabhene manjubha ghoha kila linjubha, ngati kakotoke kubhegha nga yumoo ywenu ywakatenditwe nnonopo kwa ukuluho ghwa ulemwa. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Twenga twaaghendelela kubhegha mukulilunga na Kilisito, handa twaakamulana na udumbilo ghuutubheghite naghwo kutandila mbaka kuuhiko, <verse eid="HEB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />handa Matyeko paghatyekitwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">“Handa pamuliyihwa lilobhe lya Chapanga lelo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">nkotoke kubhegha na ngakatala handa paatendite aghohi bhenu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">Pala paangilukite.”<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Ndo aghani abho bhaayihwite lilobhe lya Chapanga na bhakinkiluka? Ndo bhala bhoha bhaalongohitwe na Musa kukibhala kuhuma ku Misili. <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Chapanga kakiyaghabhihwa na aghani mu ngungwa mbinda mabhoko ncheche? Kakiayaghabhalila bhala bhaatendite ulemwa, mitumba yabhe yikibhegha pilikichi kula kukibhala. <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Chapanga pakalapite “Maayingila ng'obhe pa kupughwa kwa nenga,” kakialapila aghani? Kakibhegha kakilongela kwa kya bhala bhaakilukite. <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Hino, tungubhona kukita bhakiyingila ng'obhe akwo kwa ghwangahyubhalila kwabhe.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Hino, kiyaha yila naghilo ya kuyingila pakupughwa yikali yibhegha, ndo tuyoghope ngati ywohele nkati yetu kakotoke kulepelwa kuyingila paupughwo aghwo. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Mana ndo hoto, na twenga tulandamihwa Nhalo ghwa Maha ghughula ghula handa bhaalandamihitwe bhombe. Peni lilagho lila lyaliyihwite likianogha ng'obhe, kiyaha likihangangana ng'obhe na kuhyubhalila. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Hino, twenga tuhyubhalilite tungumokola upughwo aghwo ghwakatulaghilite Chapanga. Handa pakalongelite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">“Nikiyaghabhala na nikilapa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">‘Bhaayingila ng'obhe paupughwo ghwangu.’”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Chapanga kakighalongela agho hata payibheghite lihengo lyake likiyomoka kala kutandila pakaghubhumbite unnima. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Pamoo pamu Matyeko ghatyekwa yakya linjubha lya saba, “Chapanga kakipumulila linjubha lya saba, na kakileka mahengo ghake ghoha.” <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Kangi bahapa apa patyekwa, “Bhaayingila ng'obhe pakupughwa kwa nenga.” <verse eid="HEB 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Hino, aghwo naghilo lya kuyingila pakupughwa likali kubhegha, kubhukana na bhala bhaalandamihitwe Nhalo ghwa Maha pala kandahi, bhakilepelwa kuyingila amwo, kiyaha bhakiyitikila ng'obhe. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Chapanga kakilibhika linjubha lingi liikemwa “Lelo.” Mbole ya ngungwa ndangalo kakilongela kangi kwa njila ya Daudi malagho ghakaghakambukite kala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">“Handa lelo pamuliyihwa lilobhe lya Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">ghukotoke kubhegha na ngakatala.”<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Kiyaha Yoshua kakiapegha bhandu abho upughwo, mbole ya agho Chapanga kangalongela ng'obhe ya kya linjubha lingi lya kupughwa. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Kya habhu, kukali kubhegha na kupughwa kwa bhandu bha Chapanga mu linjubha lya saba. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Mana, kila ywakayingila pa upughwo ghwa Chapanga, kaapumulila kubhuka mu lihengo lyake, handa bhula Chapanga pakapughwite pakayomolite lihengo lyake. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Hino, tukangamale kuyingila mu upughwo aghwo, ngati kakotoke kubhegha ywohele mu nkati yetu ywakalepelwa kuyitikila handa pabhatendite bhombe ghwangahyubhalila.<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Kiyaha Lilagho lya Chapanga libhegha na ubhumi na libhegha, na libhegha na makakala, lingutema kupitingana lukechelo lungutema mbande hyoha. Lungutema mbaka mu ng'ebhu payikongana mwoyo na nhuki, lingutema mbaka mu uloyhwo na mahuta. Lilagho alyo linguhangula hwacho na ulamulo ghwa myoyo ya bhandu. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Hangi kahone kibhumbe kyakulihiha muulongolo ghwa Chapanga, hilibhi hyoha hyahwimulighwa muulongolo ghwake, kwa ywombe ndo yingutunogha kubhuha mmalango ghwa ndendelo yetu.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo Ndundame Nkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Hino, handa tubhegha na Ndundame Nkulu kupitingana bhoha ywakayingilite kunani kwa Chapanga, aywo ndo Yesu Mwana ghwa Chapanga, na tughukamulile muno uhyubhalilo ghwetu. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Ndundame ayu Nkulu kangughumanya uyoyobhalo ghwetu, aywo mwene kaking'ehwa handa twenga mu milando yoha peni kakitenda ng'obhe ulemwa. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Habhu, tukiheghelele kyanga lyogha kiteho kya utabhala ghwa Chapanga yuna luhungu, ngati tumokole luhungu na umaha ghwa kututangatila mu mapungwo.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Kiyaha ndundame nkulu ywohele ywakahaghulitwe mu anabhandu, aywo kabhikwa kwa kya bhandu mu milando yiibheghite ya Chapanga, ngati kabhuhe nyambi na bhwengu kwa kya ulemwa. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Kya bhula aywo ndundame mwene kabhegha na uyoyobhalo, kaahotola kubhatendela kwa luhungu bhala bhaatenda ulemwa kyanga kumanya na bhanakutenda uhokelo, <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Kwa kya agho, kangunoghwa kubhuha nyambi kwa kya ulemwa ghweka, ngati kwa kya ulemwa ghwa kya ywombe bhubho. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Na kahone mundu yunakulihaghula mwene kubhegha Ndundame, ngati kangukemwa na Chapanga, handa bhula Aluni.<verse eid="HEB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Ubhwabhu abhu Kilisito naywo kakilikweha ng'obhe mwene uhokamo ghwa kubhegha Ndundame Nkulu, peni Chapanga kakinng'ombela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">“Ghwenga ndo Mwana ghwangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">Na lelo menga Tate ghwako.”<verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Handa payityekitwe pamoo pangi mu Matyeko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">“Ghwaabhegha ndo Ndundame ghwa manjubha ghoha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">kwa nnandano ghwa undundame ghwa Melikisedeki.”<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Yesu pakabheghite na ubhumi pa nnima aghu, kakilila kwa lilobhe likulu na mahohi, kakinhokamila na kunnyupa Chapanga ywakabheghite na makakala gha kunnopoha mu kiho, naywo Chapanga kakinnyihwa Yesu kiyaha kakibha yunakutundamila muulongolo ghwake. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Hata pakabhele kakibhegha Mwana ghwa Chapanga, peni kakilihunda kuyitikila mu njila ya himbamanda. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Naywo pakatwihilihitwe kala kakibhegha nhokolo ghwa ulopoho ghwa manjubha ghoha kyanga uhiko kwa bhandu bhaannyitikila, <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />Mbole Chapanga kakinninga kubhegha ndundame nkuluhanda pakabheghite Melikisedeki.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukinyo kwa kya kuleka uhyubhalilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Tubhegha na malagho matangalo gha kubhaghombela kwa kya undundame ghwa Yesu, peni ndo unonopo kualubhulila kiyaha munakutopa bha kumanya. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Kiyaha mu manjubha agha yinguibhanogha kubhegha ahunda, peni nkali mungunoghwa kubhegha na mundu ghwa kuahunda mahundo gha kandahi ya lilagho lya Chapanga. Mungunoghwa kunywegha mabhele kihyengo kya hilyo hinonopo. <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Ywohele ywakanoghwa kuyonga mabhele ndo kakali mwana king'enya, mana aywo kangumanya ng'obhe ghamaha na mahakata. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Peni bhandu bhaalyegha hilyo hinonopo ndo akamala kala, mana bhaahunditwe kwa mandendelo kufwambula umaha na uhakata.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Hino, mbaha tughendelele kuulongolo kyanalumu, mu mahundo ghaakamilite na kuleka kunyuma mahundo gha kandahi ya kya lilagho lya Kilisito. Kangi tukotoke kuhighala mu ghala mahundo gha kandahi yaghalinga kulipetula kubhukana na kutama kwanga kunyeleha Chapanga na yakya kunhyubhalila Chapanga, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />na mahundo gha ubatiso na gha kuayupila bhandu kwa kubhayabhikila mabhoko, na gha uhyuko na toso ya manjubha ghoha. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Kwa kutenda habho twaaghendelela kukula na kukamala mu uhyubhalilo pakapala Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Kiyaha bhandu bhala bhayimanyite kala hoto ya kya Chapanga, na kukingama hilibhi hya maha ya kunani kwa njila ya Nhuki ghwa Chapanga, <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />na kumanya kya maha kukita lilagho lya Chapanga ndo la maha, na kangi bhangumanya makakala gha utabhala ghwa Chapanga mu nnima ghuupala kuhika, <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />na mbole bhakikiluka uhyubhalilo, yahotoleka ng'obhe kubhabhuyiha bhalipetule kangi, kiyaha bhangummangalila Mwana ghwa Mundu kya ubhili kwa likaho na kunnyuyuha pekupeku.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Kiyaha lutupi luukomelwa hula maghenda maghenda na kumela mimela yinakupapa mapambiko kwa nkandakanda, lutupi alwo lunonelwa na Chapanga, <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />peni handa yimela mihomi na hitonamamba, kahone lumotelo, na lwaabhegha ugheghela na kukotolwa na Chapanga na muuhiko lwayochwa mwoto.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Ena maapalo ghwangu hata bhula nubhatyekela kwa malagho makalipa, hata habho nenga mmegha na ulyaghilo kukita mungutenda gha maha ghaabhoneha kukita mulopoleghwa. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Kiyaha Chapanga ndo ghwa maha, na ywombe kangukulungwa lihengo limulitendite na upalo ghumuubhonehite kwa kya mwene na lihengo limubhatendela bhandu bhake na kangi mungughendelela kubhatendela. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Twenga tungupala kila yumu ywenu, kabhonehe ubhinililo ghula ghula, ngati mmokole kumanya uhoto ghuutwihilikite ghwa ghula udumbilo mbaka kuuhiko. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Habhu nkotoke kubhegha atotoho, ngati mmeghe handa bhanakuhyubhalila na bhaabheghite na ulimbililo, na kuuhiko bhaakamuhwa yila naghilo ya Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghakalaghilite Chapanga ndo ulyaghilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Chapanga pakanlaghilite Ibulahimu, kakilapa kwa lihina lyake mwene, kiyaha kahone ywakabheghite nkulu kupitingana kwa ywombe, ywene kwa aywo kangahotolite kulapa, <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />Chapanga kakilongela, “Kulyaghila ndaghunonela na ndaghupegha ubheleko ntangalo.” <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Ibulahimu kakilimbilila na habhu kakimokola kila kyakalaghilitwe na Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Bhandu paalapa angulapa kwa yumu ywakabheghite nkulu kupitingana bhene, na kilapo kinguyomola malimbano ghoha. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Naywo Chapanga kakiyimiha naghilo yake kwa kilapo, na kwa kya akyo kakiabhoneha peku peku bhala bhaabhalaghilite kukita kahone kupotongana kila kyakalapite, <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Hinu Chapanga kakihitenda ahi hilibhi hibhili, naghilo na kilapo, hyene hyahotoleka ng'obhe kugilimbuka na kwa ahyo Chapanga kahotola ng'obhe kulongela uhwangi. Kakitenda hilibhi ahyo hibhili ngati katuyonjokehe mwoyo twenga tuntughilite ngati tughukamulile udumbilo ghwa milando yiipala kuhika. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Tubhegha na lidumbilo alyo handa ngwamiho ya kukamulila meli. Na lidumbilo alyo linguyingiha mbaka pahapa palapabhaghulitwe ya kya Chapanga ghweka kuhyeto ya lipazia pakunani. <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />Yesu mwene kalongolela kuyingila amwo kwa kya twenga na kabhegha Ndundame Nkulu mu manjubha ghoha kya nga uhiko, handa undundame ghwa Melikisedeki.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s">Ndundame Melikisedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Melikisedeki kakibhegha mutwa ghwa ku Salemu, na ndundame nkulu ghwa Chapanga ywa kunani muno. Ibulahimu pakabheghite kangubhuya kuhuma ku ngondo kwene kakibhakoma abhatwa ncheche, Melikisedeki kakikongana naywo na kakinnonela, <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />naywo Ibulahimu kakinpegha lifungu limu mu kila mafungu mbinda mabhoko yimo gha hilibhi hyahikamokolite. Na fwambulo ya kipalamande kya kandahi kya lihina lyake ndo, “Mutwa ghwa shaliaya” Na bhubho “Mutwa ghwa ku Salemu”, fwambulo yake ndo “Mutwa ghwa uhihimilo.” <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Kahohe ywakanmanyite tate ebu mama ghwake ghwakibhegha aghani ebu ghwa lukolo lwoki. Na kahone ywakamanya kakibhelekwa pakiki ebu kakihwegha pakiki. Melikisedeki ndo handa Mwana ghwa Chapanga kya bhula manjubha ghoha katabhegha ndundame.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Hino, munhwachile kya bhula mundu aywo pakabheghite nkulu, mbaka Ibulahimu tate ghwetu nhwadali, kakinpegha lifungu limu lya mbinda mabhoko yimu ya hilibhi hyake hyoha hyakahikokobholite ku ngondo. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Kangi tungumanya kukita, kulandana na malaghilo, bhana bha Lawi bhaatendeka kubhegha andundame na bhangulingama lifungu limu lya mbinda mabhoko yimo kuhuma kwa alongo bhabhe kubhukana na malaghilo, hata payibhele alongo bhabhe nabho ndo ubheleko ghwa Ibulahimu. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Peni aywo Melikisedeki kakibhegha ng'obhe ghwa lukolo lwa Lawi, hata habho kakikingama lifungu lya mbinda mabhoko yimo kuhuma kwa Ibulahimu, kangi kakinnemela aywo ywakakamuhitwe naghilo na Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Kahone bhwaghalili kukita nndokwa ghunonelwa na ywabhegha nkulu kupitingana kwa ywombe. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Kangi, abho andundame bhanakukingama lifungu lya mbinda mabhoko yimu ndo bhandu bhene bhaahwegha, peni apa ywakakingama lifungu lya mbinda mabhoko yimu yinguyimihwa kukita kahwegha ng'obhe na aywo ndo Melikisedeki. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Twaahotola kulongela kukita, Lawi ywene kangukingama lifungu limu lya mbinda mabhoko yimo kuhuma kwa alongo bhake, na ywombe kakibhuha alyo lifungu lyake lya mbinda mabhoko yimo kwa Melikisedeki kukindila Ibulahimu, <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />Kiyaha Melikisedeki pakakonganite na Ibulahimu, Lawi kakibha kakali mu kibhuno kya Ibulahimu.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Akaaisilaeli bhakipeghwa malaghilo ghakakamuhitwe Musa na Chapanga, na malaghilo agho ghakibhukana na undundame ghwa Akaalawi. Peni hata habho undundame aghwo ghukitwihilika ng'obhe, habho ghukinoghwa ghuhike undundame ghungi handa ghwa Melikisedeki ghwene ghwanga kulandana na undundame ghwa Aluni. <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Kiyaha undundame paghugilimbuka, yibha ndo mbaka malaghilo nagho ghagilimbuke. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Mihalo yiikambukwa ndo ya Bambo ghwetu kiyaha mwene kakibhegha ghwa likabila lingi, na kahone mundu ghwa likabila lyake ywakatendite lihengo lya undundame mu likuta. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Yingumanyika pekupeku kukita ywombe kakibhelekwa mu likabila lya Yuda lyene Musa kakilikambuka ng'obhe kwa milando ya undundame.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndundame yungi handa Melikisedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Kangi agha ghatughalongela ghabhegha peku peku muno handa kahika ndundame yungi ywakabheghite handa Melikisedeki. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />Ywombe kakitendekwa ng'obhe ndundame kwa ngwiliho na malaghilo gha anabhandu kwa kya undundame, ngati kakibhegha ndundame kwa makakala gha ubhumi ghwake ghwa manjubha ghoha na ghwanga uhiko. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Kiyaha yityekwa mu Malaghilo, “Ghwenga ndo Ndundame ghwa manjubha ghoha na ghanga uhiko, handa ndundame Malikisedeki.” <verse eid="HEB 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Hino, lila lilaghilo lya makachu lya undundame likibhuhwa kiyaha likibhegha liyoyobhalo na yikibhegha ya yayu hela. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />Kiyaha malaghilo ghangutenda ng'obhe kilibhi kyohele kila kibhe kitwihiliko. Peni hinu tuyeghelwa lidumbilo liibheghite lya maha lyene lingutuyegha ugheghela na Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Pala Akaalawi abheghe Andundame pakibhegha ng'obhe na kilapo peni apa paundundame aghu pabhegha na kilapo kya Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Peni Yesu kakitendekwa Ndundame kwa kilapo, pala Chapanga pakang'ombelite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“Bambo kalapa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">na kahone kuyighalambula mahwacho ghake</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">‘Ghwenga ghwabhegha Ndundame ghwa manjubha ghoha kyanga uhiko.’”<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Kwa kilapo aki, Yesu ndo yunakubhoneha uhoto ghwa ninganilo liibheghite lya maha kyanalumu.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Kiyaha andundame bhala bhangi akibhegha anamundu ghweka habhu nndaluko ghwabhe ghwa kuhwegha paghuhikite bhakihwegha na bhakilepelwa kughendelela na lihengo lyake na akyo ndo kikibhegha kiyambuho kya abho kubhegha atangalo. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Peni Yesu chepa handa bhombe, ywombe kangulama manjubha ghoha kyanga uhiko, na undundame ghwake ndo ghwangapela. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Kya habhu ywombe kanguhotola kubhalopoha bhala bhanakuntughila Chapanga kukindila ywombe, kiyaha ywombe kabhegha na ubhumi ghwa manjubha ghoha na ghanga uhiko ngati kabhayupile kwa Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Hinu, Yesu ndo aywo ndundame yutunpalaha, ywombe ndo ntwihiliko, ywanga ulemwa ebu uhokelo ghwohele, na Chapanga kakimmaghula na anaulemwa na kakinkweha kunani. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Ywombe kakibhegha kafwauti na andundame bhangi, kakibhuha ng'obhe nyambi kwa kila linjubha, pakitandila kubhuha nyambi kwa kya ulemwa ghwake mwene, na mbole kubhuha nyambi kwa kya ulemwa ghwa bhandu bhangi. Ywombe kakibhuha nyambi payimu ghweka kwa kya bhoha, pakalibhuhite mwene kubhegha nyambi na ayi yikikwila kwa manjubha ghoha. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Peni kwakutughila malaghilo gha Musa, bhandu bhakibhikwa kubhegha andundame akulu payibhele bhakibhegha alemwa. Peni mbole Chapanga kakitenda kwa kilapo na kakinhaghula Mwana kabhe Ndundame Nkulu ywakatenditwe ntwihiliko mu manjubha ghoha ghanga uhiko.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Ndundame ghwetu Nkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Hino, nnando ghutughupala kulongela ndo aghu, twenga tubhegha na Ndundame Nkulu ghwa kya habhu, ywene katama mu mbande ya nnilo ya kiteho kya utabhala kya Chapanga Nkulu kunani. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Akwo kunani kangutenda lihengo lya Undundame Nkulu, mu lihema liibheghite Kunani kwa Chapanga lyene ndo pang'anyimo muno, liichengitwe na Bambo, hangi ng'obhe na anamundu.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Ndundame nkulu ywohele kahaghulwa ngati katendekehe nyambi na bhwengu. Ubhwabhu abhu, Nywo ayu Ndundame ghwetu Nkuku kangunoghwakabheghe na kilibhi kya kuyambika. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Handa Yesu kangaghendelela kutama mu nnima ndo , kangabheghite ndwee Ndundame Nkulu, kiyaha bhabhegha kala mandundame bhangi bhangutendekeha nyambi kubhukana na malaghilo gha Musa ghakapeghitwe na Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Mahengo ghabhe gha undundame ndo nhwano ghwa kihwili ghweka kya ghala ghaabheghite kunani. Kiyaha Musa pakabheghite ugheghela na kuchenga litinga lyakaghombelitwe na Chapanga, ndo Chapanga kakinng'ombela, “Ghutendekehe hilibhi hyoha kubhukana na ghula nhwano ghuulangihitwe kula kukitumbi.” <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Hinu Yesu kakamuhwa lihengo lya undundame lya maha kyanalumu. Handa bhula ninganilo lyakayimihite nkati ya Chapanga na bhandu ndo lya maha kyanalumu, kiyaha ngimiko yake yibhegha naghilo yiibheghite ya maha kyanalumu.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Kiyaha handa lila ninganilo lya kalongohi lyangabheghite ng'obhe litwihiliko, pangabheghite ng'obhe na kupalaha ninganilo lya ubhili. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Hino Chapanga kakibhona kyangatwihilika kwa bhandu bhake, naywo kakilongela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">“Manjubha ghanguhika, kalongela Bambo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">na nenga ndatenda ninganilo lya hyono na bhandu bha Isilaeli na bhandu bha Yuda.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Ninganilo lyangu lyaabhegha ng'obhe handa lila linilitendite na aghohi bhabhe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">linjubha kubhalongoha maha kuhuma ku Misili</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">Kiyaha bhakighendelela ng'obhe kulihyubhalila ninganilo lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">na nenga nikiapughana.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Hinu ali ndo ninganilo lyangu liimbala kulitenda na Akaaisilaeli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">kwa manjubha ghanguhika, kangulongela Bambo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Ndaghabhika malaghilo ghangu mumahala ghabhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">na kuyityeka mu myoyo yabhe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Ndaabhegha Chapanga ghwabhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">nabho bhaabhegha bhandu bhangu.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Kahone mundu ywa kunhunda ghanja ghwake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">ebu kunng'ombela nndamani ghwake</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">‘Ghunmanye Chapanga’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Kiyaha bhoha bhaammanya nenga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">kutandila ywakabheghite nndokwa mbaka ywakabheghite nkulu.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Ndabhalekekeha kwa uhokelo ghwabhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:12">na ndaghukulungwa ng'obhe ulemwa ghwabhe.”<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Kwa kulikema ninganilo ali lya hyono, Chapanga kangulitenda lila lya kalongohi ndo lya makachu, na kilibhi kyohele kya makachu kingubhegha kihakala na kibhegha ugheghela na kuhobha.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s">Kutundamila ku nnima na ku kunani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Lilagano lya kandahi likibhegha na malaghilo ya kutundamila na pahaghulitwe kwa kya kuntundamila Chapanga mu nnima. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Likitendekehwa lihema, na kyumba kyake kya kalongohi kikikemwa pang'anyimo muno. Amwo pakibhegha na kinyota kya limbamba, kindangabhalo na mangate ghaabhikitwe muulongolo ghwa Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Pa unyuma ghwa lipasia lya ubhili, pakibhegha na kyumba kiikemitwe pakighweka pa kya Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Apwo pakibhegha na lila lukuta lwa sahabu kwa kya kututumiha luhumba na lijamanda lya ninganilo, liityelemikitwe sahabu mu mbande hyoha, na nkati yake pakibhegha na kibhigha kya sahabu kiibhikitwe hilyo hiikemitwe mana, lukongocho lwa Aluni luuchanukite mahamba, na hila hipalamande hibhili hya maganga ghaatyekitwe malaghulo gha Musa ghakapeghitwe na Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Unani mwa lila lijamanda pakibhegha na hibhumbe hibhili hiikemitwe Makelubi hiibheghite na mbabhatila, na mbabhatila hyabhe hikigubika unani mwa kigubiko kya Lijamanda lyene bhubho lingukemwa kiteho kya lipyanda. Peni hinu twaahotola ng'obhe kulubhulila maha bhula paghabhele.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Lihema alyo palitwihilikite, mbole yikibha hitohe hya andundame kuyingila kila linjubha mu kyumba kya ulongohi kya litinga na kutenda mahengo ghabhe gha undundame. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Peni ndundame nkulu ghweka ndo ywakayingilagha mu nkati ya kila kyumba kya ubhili kya kighweka kya lihema, naywo kangutenda habho mala yimu ghweka kwa ngungwa yoha, na kahone kuyingila kyanga mwahi, ghwakaghubhuhite kwa kya mwene na kwa kya ulemwa ghwa bhandu. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Kwa kya habhu, Nhuki ghwa Chapanga kakibhegha kangulangiha kukita, kiyaha lila lihema lya kandahi likali liyima, peni njila ya kuyingila pang'anyimo muno pakibha pakali panatatwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Nnando aghwo ndo nhwano ghwa nndaluko ghwa hinu, kubhoneha kukita nyambi na bhwengu yiibhuhitwe yikihotola ng'obhe kuyoha ntima ghwa mundu yunakutundamila, <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Mana agha ghoha ghangubhukana na hilyo na hyakuywegha, papamo na hitohe hya kukuha kya panje, ghoha agho ndo malaghilo gha panjepanje ghweka, na makakala ghake ghangupela pala Chapanga pakaghabhika maha hilibhi hyoha.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Peni Kilisito kahika kala kabheghe Ndundame Nkulu ghwa milando ya maha yiihikite. Ywombe kangutenda mahengo mu lihema lya maha kyanalumu kupitingana lila lya makachu, lihema alyo likichengwa ng'obhe na bhandu, habhu lihema alyo chepa lya nnima aghu. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Ywombe kakiyingila pang'nyimo muno mala yimo ghweka, na kakitola ng'obhe mwahi ghwa mbuhi na senga, ngati nga mwahi ghwake mwene, na kutupegha ukombohi ghwa manjubha ghoha. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Mana bhandu bhangayitikilwa na Chapanga, bhakihotolwa kuyohwa na kubhegha bha nyanyi paamichilwa mwahi ghwa mbuhi na senga papamu na lihu lya mwana senga. <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />Peni kwa mwahi ghwa Kilisito, milando mikulu kyanalumu yingutendeka! kwa makakala gha Nhuki ghwa Chapanga ghwa manjubha ghoha, Kilisito kakilibhuha mwene handa nyambi yiitwihilikite kwa Chapanga. Mwahi ghwake ghungutuyogha myoyo yetu kubhukana na ndendelo yinakuyambuha kiho, ngati tumokole kuntumikila Chapanga yuna ubhumi.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Kya habhu Kilisito ndo nninganiha ghwa lilaghano lya hyono mu amwo bhala bhaakemitwe na Chapanga bhanguhotola kukamuhwa unonelo ghwanga kupela kwa ghwaalingitwe. Kiho kyake kinguakombola bhandu kuhuma kwa ghula uhokelo ghwaaghutendite mu nndaluko ghwa lila lilaghano lya makachu.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Kiyaha manjubha ghoha lihamba liityekitwe kwakya ywa kuhala hilibhi hya ywakahweghite, libhegha na makakala pala ywaatyekite kahwegha hoto. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Kiyaha lihamba lya kuhala libhegha na makakala pakahwegha mundu, kangi lilaghano alyo lyabhegha lya yaghi hela handa yula ywakalitendite kabhegha kakali kangulama. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Ndo mana hata lila lilaghano lya makachu likiyandihwa ng'obhe kyanga mwahi. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Kiyaha Musa pakaghakambukite kala malaghilo kwa bhandu bhoha, handa payibheghite mu malaghilo, kakighutola mwahi ghwa mwana senga na ghwa mbuhi, papamu na machi na mayuni makele na mapanyu gha nkongo ghuukemwa hisopo, kakikimichila akyo kitabho na kwa bhandu bhoha. <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />Kakilongela “Aghu ndo mwahi ghwa lilaghano lyakakwilikihite Chapanga kuliyitikila.” <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Ubhwabhu abhu Musa kakimichila mwahi lila lihema na hyombo hya kutundamila. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Kulyaghila, kubhukana na malaghilo, hyombo hyoha hiiyohitwe kwa mwahi, na kyanga kumichilwa mwahi kahone ulekekeho ghwa ulemwa.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyambi ya Kilisito yingubhuha ulemwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Hino, yikibhegha mbaka hilibhi hiihwananihitwe na hya kunani hiyoghwe kwa nyambi ya anyama abho, peni hilibhi hya kukunani kwa Chapanga yikipala kuyoghwa kwa nyambi yiibheghite ya maha kyanalumu. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Mana Kilisito kakuyingila ng'obhe pahala pang'nyimo na pang'anyimo muno kwa mabhoko gha anabhandu, yiibheghite nhwano ghwa hilibhi hyene hya kunani. Mwene kakiyingila kunani ku kwako kwa Chapanga kwene hinu kanguyima muulongolo ghwa Chapanga kwa kya twenga. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Ndundame Nkulu ghwa Akaayahudi kanguyingila pahala pang'anyimo muno ngungwa mala yimo pakabhegha na mwahi ghwa anyama, peni Kilisito kakiyingila ng'obhe kunani ngati kakalibhuhe mwene pipipi, <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />kiyaha handa yikibhegha habho, Kilisito yingannoghite kupamandwa na kuhwegha mala ndangalo kutandila paghubhumbitwe nnima. Peni hinu, nndaluko aghu paghuheghelela uhiko ghwake, mwene kakibwituka mala yimo ghweka, kubhuha ulemwa kwa kulibhuha nyambi mwene. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Hino, handa bhula kila mundu kaahwegha mala yimo ghweka, mbole kaayima mu ulongolo ghwa Chapanga ngati katoswe. <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />Ubhwabhu abhu, Kilisito naywo pakabhuhitwe nyambi mala yimu ngati kaghutole ulemwa ghwa bhandu atangalo. Paabwituka kya ubhili, ndo chepa kya kulimbana na ulemwa, ngati ndo kwa kubhalopola bhala bha annindila.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Hino, kiyaha malaghilo ndo kihwili ghweka kya ghala gha maha ghaapala kuhika, na ndo chepa utwihiliko ghwa milando yila ya telatele, nyambi ndo yiyila yila ya malaghilo yiitendekehwa ngungwa mbaka ngungwa, yaahotoleka ndwee kubhayoha bhandu bhala bhanakutundamila Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Handa bhandu abho bhaantundamila Chapanga bhangayohwite ulemwa ghwabhe hoto, bhangaghendelelite ng'obhe kulibhoa kukita abhegha na ulemwa, na nyambi ahyo hyoha hingalekitwe, <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />peni nyambi ahyo hiitendekwa kila ngungwa ngati kubhakulungwa bhandu ulemwa ghwabhe. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Kiyaha mwahi ghwa makambako gha senga na makambako gha mbuhi ghwahotola ng'obhe kubhuha ulemwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Kubhukana na agha, Kilisito pakabheghite kanguhika pannima, kakinng'ombela Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">“Ghukipala ng'obhe bhwengu na nyambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">peni ghukimikila kala mmili kwa kya nenga.<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />Ghungunoghelwa ng'obhe na nyambi ya kuyochwa anyama mu likuta</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:6">ebu matulo gha kuyoha ulemwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Apo ndo paanongelite, ‘Nenga megha apa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">kutenda ghaughapala, Ghwe Chapanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">handa payityekitwe ya kya nenga mu kitabho kya malaghilo’”<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Kandahi kakiyanda kulongela, “Ghulema na ghunoghelwa ng'obhe na nyambi ya kuyochwa na ya kuyoha ulemwa.” Kakilongela habhu hata payibhele bhwengu ndo nyambi yikibhegha tela na malaghilo. <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Mbole kakilongela, “Megha apa, Ghwe Chapanga hika kughatenda mapalo ghako.” Habhu Chapanga kakigilimbula nyambi ya makachu na kihyengo kyake kakibhika nyambi yingi yimu. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Kiyaha Yesu Kilisito kakitwihilia mapalo gha Chapanga, twenga tunguyohwa na kutendwa bhaabhaghulitwe kwa kya Chapanga kwa njila ya nyambi ya mmili ghwa Yesu Kilisito ghuubhuhitwe mala yimo ghweka.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Ndundame ywohele Nnyahudi kangutenda lihengo lyake lya kutundamila kila linjubha na kutendekeha nyambi yila yila patangalo, nyambi yene yangahotola kubhua ulemwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Peni Kilisito kakitenda nyambi yimu kwa kya ulemwa, nyambi yinakutenda lihengo manjubha ghoha, mbole kakitama mbande ya nnilo ya Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />Kutandila apo kangualindila amyanja bhake mbaka kabhabhike pahi mu utabhala ghwake. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Hino, kiyaha Kilisita kakilibhuha nyambi mala yimu, kabhayoha ulemwa ngati mmeghe bhandu bhake manjubha ghoha mu mamjubha ghoha bhala bhoha bhaayohwa ulemwa ghwabhe.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Naywo Nhuki ghwa Chapanga kangutughombea yakya nnando aghu kwa kulongela,<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />“Ali ndo ninganilo liimbala kutenda nabho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">manjubha ghaapala kuhika, kangulongela Bambo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">Ndabhika malaghilo ghangu mu myoyo yabhe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">na kughatyeka malaghilo ghangu mu mahala ghabhe.”<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Mbole kakighendelela kulongela, “Ndaghukulungwa ng'obhe kangi ulemwa hangi uhokelo ghwabhe.” <verse eid="HEB 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Hino, ulemwa paghubhuhwa, kahone nhokolo ghwa kubhuha nyambi ya kughubhuha ulemwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tunheghelele Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Hino, maalongo bhango, kwa mwahi ghwa Yesu tungupeghwa mwoyo ghuukangamalite ghwa kuyingila pang'anyimo munu. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />Ywombe katuhughulila njila ya hyono, njila ya ubhumi, kukindila lila lipasia ghwene ndo mmili ghwake mwene. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Hino, tubhegha na Ndundame nkulu nnolelekeha ghwa nyumba ya Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />Hino, tunheghelele Chapanga kwa mwoyo ya nyanyi yene yinakunhyubhalila hoto, patubhegha na myoyo yiiyohitwe kubhukana na hwacho hakataho, na mibhili yiighululitwe kwa machi gha nyanyi. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Tughungile lidumbilo lyetu litulihyubhalila na litulikambuka kyanga bhwaghalili, kiyaha Chapanga ywakatendite naghilo lyake ndo ywa kuhyubhalika. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Kangi tungunoghwa kuyonjokehana myoyo ngati tupalane na kutendelana gha maha twenga kwa twenga mu mapalo na mu kughatenda gha maha. <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Kangi tukotoke kuleka hila hitohe hya kukungana papamu, handa paatenda bhangi paalekite kukongana, kangi yingutunogha kuyonjokehana myoyo handa paatenda bhangi, Linjubha lila lya Chapanga linguheghelela.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Handa patughendelela kutenda ulemwa kwa likaho mbole ya kupeghwa ghula umaha ghwa yila hoto, kahone nyaambi yaahotolekwa kubhuhwa kwa kya kutubhuhila ulemwa. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />Peni kiihighalite ndo kulindila toso ya Chapanga kwa lyogha na mwoto nkalipa ghwakubhakanjaghana bhaannema Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Mundu ywehele ywakaghalemite malaghilo gha Musa kaakomwagha kyanga luhungu, mbaka pabheghe uyimiho ghwa bhandu abhili ebu andatu. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Bhuli, munguhwachila bhuli yikinnogha ng'obhe kihyato kiibheghte kikulu kyanalumu mundu yula ywakanpughana Mwana ghwa Chapanga, na kubhoa mwahi ghwa ninganilo ghuunnyohite kukita ndo kilibhi kihakata, na kuntendela hyeta Nhuki luhungu? <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Kiyaha tungummanya kukita Chapanga kakilongela, “Lihengo lya kubhuyiha kibhuyiho ndo lihengo lyang” Na hila hila Chapanga kakilongela, “Kataatosa bhandu bhake.” <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Ndo nnando ghwa kuyoghoha muno, kukukongana na toso ya Chapanga yuna ubhumi.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Mughakulungwe manjubha ghala gha kalongohi, pannyandite kuhyubhalila Kilisito, payibhele mukimokola kimbamanda peni mukilimbilila. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Pamoo pangi mukilighwa na kuyuyuhwa mu muu, pamoo pangi mukinoghwa kubhatangatila bhala bhaapamanditwe handa mwenga. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Mukiabhonela luhungu bhala bhaabheghite mu hiphopo, mukiyitikila kwa uyelelo kutolelwa utopelo ghwenu kiyaha mukimanya kukita mu myoyo yenu hikibhegha hilibhi hyanga kupela manjubha ghoha. <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Hino, nkotoke kughuhobheha ukangamalo ghwenu, kiyaha mwaakamuhwa lilumbo likulu kuhuma kwa Chapanga <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Yinguanogha mmeghe na ulimbililo ngati mmokole kughatwihiliha mapalo gha Chapanga na kupeghwa kila kyakanaghihite. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Handa paghatyekitwe Matyeko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">Kukali midaluko michoko hela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">Yula yunakuhika katahika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">na kaabhalila ng'obhe.<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Peni yunakutama handa pambala, katalama kwa kunhyubhalila nenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">na handa katanyumanyuma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">ndabhegha ng'obhe na uyelelo naywo.”<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Peni twenga tubhegha ng'obhe handa bhandu bhanakuleka kuntughila Chapanga na kuhobha, ngati tubhegha papamu na bhandu bhaanhyubhalila na kulopoleghwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s">Kunhyubhalila Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Hino, kunhyubhalila Chapanga ndo kubhegha na ulyaghilo ghwa kukita milando yitulidumbila yaatendekwa. Kangi ndo kudumbila kyanalumu milando yangabhonekana hinu. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Kiyaha, kwa njila ya kunhyubhalila Chapanga, aghohi bhetu bhakinnogheha muno Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Kwa kuhyubhalila tungumanya kukita nnima ghukibhumbwa kwa lilagho lya Chapanga, na hilibhi hyoha hinakubhonekana hikitendekwa ng'obhe kuhuma kwa hilibhi hyangabhonekana.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Kwa kuhyubhalila Abeli kakimmuhila Chapanga nyambi ya maha kupitingana Kaini, na habhu kakiyimihwa kukita kakibhegha ywa maha muulongolo ghwa Chapanga, na Chapanga mwene kakiiyitikila nyambi yake, kya habhu hata payibhele Abeli kakihwegha peni kuhyubhalilo kwake kakali kangughendelela kutuhunda mbaka lelo.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Kya kunhyubhalila Chapanga kukintenda Henoki katolwe mu nnima kya nga kuhwegha. Kakibhonekana ng'obhe kiyaha kakitolwa na Chapanga. Kiyaha Matyeko ghungulaha kukita kukali na kutolwa kakiyimihwa kukita kakibha ghwa maha muulongolo ghwa Chapanga. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Peni kyanga kunhyubhalia Chapanga, kiyaha mundu ywakanng'endela Chapanga mbaka kahyubhalile kukita Chapanga kabhegha na kukita kanguapegha hilumbo bhala bhanakunpalaha kwa ukangamalo.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Kwa kunhyubhalila Chapanga Nuhu kakinnyitikila Chapanga pakakinyitwe kwa milando yiibheghite yikali kubhonekana. Ndo kakitendekeha lisafina ngati Chapanga kabhalopohe ywombhe na bhandu bhaabheghite mu lubhanga lwake na kubhatosa bhandu bha bha nnima bhanga kunhyulila Chapanga, kwa kya habhu Nuhu kakiyitikilwa na Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Kuhyubhalila kwake Ibulahimu kukintenda kannyitile Chapanga pala pakanng'ombilite kabhuke na kakimanya ng'obhe kula kwakapala kughenda. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Kwa kuhyubhalila kakilibhika lihema lyake mu nnima ghwa naghilo kakatame handa nhenja, kakitama mu matinga, handa pabhatendite Isaka na Yakobo, bhaabheghite bubho ahala papamu naywo kwa naghilo yiyila yila. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Kiyaha Ibulahimu kakibhegha kangulindila kitami kiibheghite na kitamiko kya manjubha ghoha, kitami kyene Chapanga mwene ndo ntendehi ghwa kukihwacha na kukichenga.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Kwa kuhyubhalila kwake Ibulahimu, hata payibhele Sala kakihyubhalila kukita Chapanga kaatwihilikiha naghilo yake, kya habho kakinemelwa kuyima ndumbo hata bhula ngungwa yake yikikinda muno. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Kyahabho kuhuma kwa mundu aywo yumu, Ibulahimu, ywakabheghite handa kahwegha, bhakibheleka bhandu atangalo bhangabhalangika handa bhula ndondwa ya kunani na nhanga ghwa kumbwani.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Bhandu abha bhoha bhakihwegha mu kuhyubhalila Chapanga, bhakihwegha yikali na kupokela milando yakaalaghilite Chapanga, peni bhakibhona kya kutali, bhakilumbilila na kukambuka pekupeku kikita bhombe akibhegha ahenja na bhaabheghite mu mwanja mu nnima. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Bhandu bhanakulongela milando handa ayi, bhangubhoneha pekupeku kukita bhanguupalaha nnima ghwabhe bhene. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Kulyaghila handa bhangabheghite bhanguhwachila nnima ghwaabhukite, bhangamokolite ng'ebu ya kubhuya akwo. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Peni hinu bhangughupala nnima ghwa maha kyanalumu, nnima ghwa kunani kwa Chapanga, habhu ndo Chapanga kangubhona honi ng'obhe kukemwa ywombe ndo Chapanga ghwabhe, kiyaha yumwene kabhatendekehela kala kitami.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Ibulahimu kwa kuhyubhalila kwake Chapanga, kakitenda kammuhe Isaka mwana ghwake kubhegha nyambi, ywombe ywakakamuhite naghilo ya Chapanga kakibhegha kala kummuuha mwana ghwake, ywakabheghite mwana ghwa kya kighweka, <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />hata bhula Chapanga kakinng'ombela, “Ubheleko ghwako ghwaahumila kwa Isaka.” <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Ibulahimu kakihyubhalila kukita Chapanga kaahotola kuahyuha bhaahweghite. Na pangi kulyaghila twaahwacha hoto kulongela Ibulahimu kakimmokola kangi Isaka kuhuma kwa bhaahweghite.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Kwa kuhyubhalila kwa Isaka kukiyambuha kabhanonele Yakobo na Esau, amokole unonelo ghuupala kuhika.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Kwa kuhyubhalila Yakobo kukintenda kakibhanonela bhana abhili bha Yosefu pabheghite ugheghela na kuhwegha kunu pakakayeghamila mutwe ghwake unani mwa lukongocho lwake.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Kwa kuhyubhalila Yosefu pakabheghite ugheghela na kuhwegha, kakilongela ya kya kubhuka kwa Akaaisilaeli mu nnima ghwa Misili, na kangi kakialaghila bhatende niki kwa kya mihupa yake.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Kwa kuhyubhalila kwa abhele bha Musa kukiatenda bhanhihe aywo mwana kwa mwehi mindatu mbole ya kubhelekwa. Bhakimmona kukita ndo mwana yuna kuhalala, na bhakiyitila ng'obhe ngwiliho ya mutwa.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Kwa kuhyubhalila kwa Musa kukintenda pakabheghite nkulu kakilema kukemwa mwana ghwa biti Falao. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Kakibhona yikibha mbaha kupamandwa na bhandu bha Chapanga kupitingana kuyelelwa ulemwa kwa nndaluko ghwamandina. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Kakimanya kukita kupamandika kwa kya Kilisto kubhegha na motelo ngulu kupitingana utopelo ghoha ghwa nnima ghwa Misili, kiyaha kakibhegha pakalindila lilumbo liipala kuhika.<verse eid="HEB 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Kwa kuhyubhalila kwa Musa kukintenda kabhuke mu nnima ghwa Misili kyanga kuyoghopa kiyaghabhu kya mutwa, na kakibhuya ng'obhe unyuma, kiyaha kakibhegha handa mundu ywakammonite Chapanga ywangabhonekana. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Kwa kuhyubhalila kakitendekeha Pasaka na kutyelemeka mwahi mu hisingiti hya milyango, ngati yula yunakubhakanjaghana abhelekwa bha ulongohi, kakotoke kubhakanjaghana abhelekwa bha Isilaeli.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Kwa kuhyubhalila bhandu bha Isilaeli bhakiyomboka lihibha lya Shamu handa nnima nnyumu, peni Akaamisili pabhayighite kuyomboka bhakimilwa na machi.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Kwa kuhyubhalila hindupa hya kitami kya Yeliko hikighwegha bhandu bha Isilaeli pabhatindilite hindupa ahyo kwa manjubha saba. <verse eid="HEB 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Kwa kuhyubhalila kwake kukintenda Lahabu ywakabheghite ntyahe kakotoke kukanjabhanwa papamu na bhala bhaankilukite Chapanga, kiyaha kakiakingama bhaalaghilitwe kulolekeha bhandu bha nnima aghwo abhegha bhuli.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Hino, nongele niki kyanalumu? Masaa ghangundegheka ng'obhe kulubhulila yakya Gidioni na Balaka na Samsoni na Yefta na Daudi na Samueli na akaambuye. <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />Kwa kuhyubhalila abha bhoha bhakitutana ngondo na abhatwa, na bhakihotola. Bhakitenda shaliya, na bhakighakingama ghala ghakalaghihite Chapanga. Bhakiyitata milomo ya mahimba, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />bhakihima myoto mikalipa, bhakihyepetuka kukomwa kwa lukechelo, akibhegha ayoyobhalo peni bhakikamuha makakala. Bhakibhegha ahwadali mu ngondo, na bhakikibhahotola amachonda bha kihenja. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Kwa kuhyubhalila adala bhakibhuyihila alongo bhabhe bhaabheghite bhahwegha paabhegha ahyuka.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Amoo bhabhe bhakilema kuhughulilwa, bhakipamandwa mbaka kuhwegha ngati amokole kuhyuhwa na kuyingila mu ubhumi ghwa maha kyanalumu. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Bhangi bhakiyuyuhwa na kututwa hinjupunjupu, na bhangi bakibhopwa minyololo na kutaghwa mu hibhopo. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Bhakihwegha kwa kututwa kwa maganga, bhakibalulwa hipalamande hipalamande, na bhakikomwa kwa lukechelo. Bhakitindilatindila kunu paahwalihwa mayula gha mene na mbuhi, bhakibhegha bhandu makapukwa na kutendelwa mahakata. <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Bhandu bha unnima bhakiapala ng'obhe bhandu abho bha maha, bhakitangatanga mu kibhala na mu hitumbi na kutama mu mabhumba gha mapango mulutupi.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Bhandu abho bhoha bhakinnogheha Chapanga kwa kuhyubhalila kwabhe. Peni kyanga ywakakingamite ghala ghakalaghilite Chapanga, <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />bhakighakingama ng'obhe agho kiyaha Chapanga katubhikila milando ya maha kyanalumu ngati, twenga papamu na bhombe tuyelelwe nonelo ahyo.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s">Chapanga ndo Tate ghwetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Kwa kya agho, twenga tubhegha na lumati lukulu lwa ayimiho muulongolo ghwetu. Hinu tubhuhe kila kilibhi kiitukingikiha, na ulemwa ghula ghuutukamula kanongola. Tutughe kwa ulimbililo mu malimbano ghaabhikitwe mu ulongolo ghwetu. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />Hino, na tunlolekehe muno Yesu, ywene ywakayandihite na kutwihiliha uhyubhalilo ghwetu, ywene kwa kya uyelelo ghuubhikitwe mu manjubha ghaapala kuhika kakilimbilila kiho mu lupingika, kyanga honi naywo katama mu mbande ya nnilo ya kiteho kya utabhala ghwa Chapanga <verse eid="HEB 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Nhwachile muno yakya milando yinbwitukilite Yesu, bhula pakalimbililite upingiko nkulu kuhuma kwa bhandu alemwa. Hino nkotoke kudunyuka mwoyo, ebu kubhuya kunyuma. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Kiyaha mukulimbana kwa twenga na ulemwa, peni yikali mwenga mukitutana ng'obhe mbaka kuyita mwahi ghwenu. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Bhuli, mukighalibhalila ghala malagho gha kuyonjokeha myoyo yene Chapanga kanguakema mwenga bhana bhake?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">“Mwana ghwangu, ghukotoke kunpughana Chapanga pakakuhyatula,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">ebu ghukotoke kudunyuka mwoyo pakakulakalila.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Kiyaha Bambo kaammuyihila ywohele ywakanpala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:6">na kaanhyatula ywohele ywakayitikila kubhegha mwana ghwake.”<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Nnimbilile ihyatulo kwa kya kulihunda. Chapanga kataatendela mwenga handa bhana bhake, kiyaha ndo mwana ywoki aywo ywangahyatulighwa na abhele bhake? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Chapanga kangubhahyata bhana bhake bho, handa mwenga mmegha bhana mbunjilo. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Kangi twenga twabhoha tubhegha na atate bhaatulelite, bhaatuhyatulite na twenga tukiahokamila. Bhuli, yingutunogha ng'obhe kulihuluha kyanalumu kwa Tate ghwa mihuki yetu ngati tulame? <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Atate bhetu bhakituhyatula kwa manjubha gha mandina handa bhene paabhonite yikibha tela, peni Chapanga kangutuhyatula kwa kya mahokelo ghetu ngati tutame na tulilunge muumaha ghwa ywombe. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Kuhyatulwa chepa nnando ghwa kuyeleleha ngati kuhyononeha. Peni kwa bhala bhaahunditwe kwa njila ya kuhyatwa bhangutama kwa uhihimiloa muulongolo ghwa Chapanga .<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahundo na makinyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Hino, nnyinule mabhoko ghenu ghaaleghelekite na kughapegha makakala mayughwa ghenu ghaaloghoya. <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />Nng'endelele kutyanga mu njila yiighololokite, ngati kila kyanga kutyanga kikotoke kuyoyobhala ngati mbaha kilamihwe.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Nkangamale kutama kwa uhihimilo na bhandu bhoha. Ntame maha kyanga kutenda ulemwa, kiyaha kahone mundu ywakahotola kummona Chapanga kyanga kutama handa habhu. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Nnolekehe muno, mundu kakotoke ywakapala kulepelwa kukingama umaha ghwa Chapanga, mmeghe meho ngati mundu ywohe kubhegha lukigha lwa nkongo lunakubhaghaya, na na kubhapamanda bhandu kwa lusungu lwake. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Mulindakile ngati nkati yenu kakotoke kubhegha mundu yuna nhakata ebu ywanga nntundamila Chapanga handa Esau, ywakahemenganite shaliya yake ya kubhegha nbhelekwa ghwa kalongohi kwa hilyo ya mala yimo. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Mwenga mungumanya hata pakapalite kumokola kangi unonelo ghula ghuubheghite ghwa ywombe, kakilemwa, kiyaha kakimokola kangi ng'obhe ng'ebu ya kulipetula, hata bhula kakiipalaha kwa mahohi.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Mwenga muukihikila ng'obhe ku kitumbi kya Sinai kinakuhotolika kukamulika, mukihika ng'obhe mu mwoto ghuuyakite paabheghite mahundi mapili na lubhindo na likusi, <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />kuubheghite na lilobhe lya litalumbeta, ebu lilobhe liikambukite malagho gha kuyoghoha mbaka bhala bhaaghombilitwe bhakiyupa bhakotoke kughombelwa kilibhi kingi, <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />kiyaha bhakihotola ng'obhe kulimbilila lilagho lila lyaakwilikihitwe, “Hata handa nnyama kaakikamula kitumbi aki, kaatutwa kwa maganga mbaka kuhwegha.” <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Bhakighabhona gha kuyoghoha mbaka Musa kakilongela, “Nunguloghoya muno kwa lyogha.”<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Peni mwenga nhika mu kitumbi kya Sayuni, Yelusalemu ya kunani kwa Chapanga, kitami kya Chapanga yunaubhumi. Nhika mu ngwemuko ngulu ya andumitumi bha kunani kwa Chapanga elufu elufu bhanga mmalango bhanakulumbalila. <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />Mu ngwemuko lya abhelekwa ghwa ulongohi bha Chapanga, bhene mahina ghabhe ghatyekwa kunani. Nhika kwa Chapanga yunakutosa bhandu bhoha, mu mitima ya bhandu bha maha bhene Chapanga kabhatenda bhayitikilwe muulongolo ghwake bhaatwihilikite. <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />Nhika kwa Yesu yunakualnganiha malobhe bhandu na Chapanga kwa ninganilo lya hyono, na kwa mwahi ghuumichilitwe, ghula ghuulongilite Mihalo ya Maha kupitingana mwahi ghwa Abeli.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Hino, mulindakile nkotoke kunnema ywakalongela na mwenga. Handa bhene bhaahyepetuka ng'obhe kuhyatulwa pabhannemite ywombe ywakaakinyite munnima aghu, Bhuli twenga, twaalopoka bhuli handa twaanyihwa ng'obhe yula ywaatukinya kuhuma kunani? <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Mu manjubha ghala lilobhe lyake linakungwangwaliha nnima, peni hinu kalongela, “Mu mala yimo ghweka ndaghungwangwaliha maha ng'obhe nga nnima ghweka peni na kunani kwa Chapanga bhubho <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Peni lilagho alyo “kangi” Lingulangiha kukita hilibhi hyoha hiingwangwalikite, ngati ihighale hilibhi ywanga kuhotola kutingihikando hila hibhumbe hiibhumbitwe, kwa likaho hila hilibhi hyanga kuloghoya hiighale. <verse eid="HEB 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Twenga nino, mana tukamuhwa ghubhutwa ghwanga kungwangwalihwa, ndo mmeghe na umaha ghwa Chapanga, na kwa agho tummuhile Chapanga utundamo ghwa maha, papamu na utekulo na umaha, <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />kiyaha Chapanga ghwetu ndo handa mwoto nkalipa ghunakulaghaliha.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s">Ya kya kunnyeleha Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Nng'endelele kupalana handa muyinoghwa kwa bhandu bhaanhyubhalila Kilosito. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Nkotoke kulibhala kuakingama ahenja mu mabhagha ghenu, kiyaha kwa kutenda habhu, bhandu bhangi bhakiakingama andumitumi bha kunani kwa Chapanga kyanga kumanya. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Mubhakulungwe bhala bhaabheghite mu hibhopo handa bhula mmopwa papamu na bhombe. Mubhakulungwe bhaabheghite mu himbamanda handa bhula mungupamandwa papamu nabho.<verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Kutolana kungupalwa kuhokamilwa na bhandu bhoha, na shaliya yaki yitendekwe kwa kuhyubhalika. Kiyaha Chapanga kataatosa atyahe na angongola.<verse eid="HEB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Nkotoke kubhegha bhandu bha kupala mbiya, nnyukutwe na hilibhi himmeghite naywo. Kiyaha mwene Chapanga kalongela, “Kulyaghila ndabhaleka ng'obhe kubhatagha” <verse eid="HEB 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Hino ndo mana tunguhotola kulongela kwa ukangamalo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">“Chapanga ndo ywakundangatila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">ndayoghopa ng'obhe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">Mundu katandenda niki?”<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Mubhakulungwe hilongohi bhenu bhaabhahundite lilagho lya Chapanga. Nhwache bhula paatamite, na nnyighe mu hyubhalilo ghwabhe. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Yesu Kilisito ndo yula yula, licho, lelo na manjubha ghoha kyanga uhiko. <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Nkotoke kuyebhehwa kunu na kunu na mahundo gha kihenja. Umaha ghwa Chapanga ndo ghuuyitenda mihuki yenu ikamale na kata kuyitikila makanikiho gha hilyo, makanikiho agho ghanguntangatila ng'obhe ywohele ywakaghatughilite.<verse eid="HEB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Twenga tubhegha na likuta kuntundamila Chapanga na mandundame bha Akaayahudi bhaatenditeghe mahengo mu pahala pa lihema lya kuntundamila Chapanga, bhanguteghekwa ng'obhe kulyegha hilibhi hiibhikitwe nkati mwake. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Ndundame nkulu kakitola mwahi ghwa anyama na kughuyegha pang'anyimo muno, handa nyambi ya ulemwa, peni mibhili ya abho anyama yikiyochwa panje ya kitami, habhu ndo Yesu kakipamandwa na kukomwa panji ya kitami ngati tumokole kuyohwa bhandu kwa mwahe ghwake mwene. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Ubhwabhu abhu Yesu kakibhangaliwa panje ya kitami ngati kaayohe bhandu kwa mwahi ghwake. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Kya habhu na tunng'endele panje ya kitami, patukiyitola honi ywakayigheghite. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Kiyaha apa pannima tubhegha ng'obhe na kitami kya manjubha ghoha kya nga uhiko, ngati tungukipalaha kila kitami kiipala kuhika. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Hino, kwa njila ya Yesu tungughendelela kunbhuhila Chapanga nyambi na tiko, kiyaha malagho ghetu gha kulitika lihina lyake ndo handa nyambi yetu yitummuhila. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Nng'enelele kubhatngatila ayenu kwa hilibhi hiimmeghite nahyo, kwa kutenda habhu kiyaha bhwengu handa aghwo ndo ghungunnyeleha Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Mubhayitikile hilongohi bhenu na kukamula ghaabhalaghila. Kiyaha abho bhangulibhuha kwa kya mwenga kya nga kutotokela na bhangunoghwa kulubhulila lihengo lyabhe muulongolo ghwa Chapanga.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Mutuyupile, kiyaha tungulitumba kutenda gha maha kwa bhandu bhoha <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Ningubhayupa kyanalumu munnyupile kwa Chapanga ngati mokole kubhuyihwa kwa mwenga kanongola.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mayupo gha kuyomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Hino, Chapanga kanhyuhite kuhuma kwa bhaahweghite Bambo ghwetu Yesu Kilisito ywene ndo nhakilaNkulu ghwa mene, kwa mwahi ghwa ninganilo lya manjubha ghoha kyanga uhiko, <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />Chapanga kabhapeghe makakala gha kutenda ghala ghakaghapala kangi katende mu myoyo yenu kwa njila ya Yesu Klisito, ywombe katikwe kwa manjubha ghoha Kya nga uhiko.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagho gha kuyomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Maalongo bhangu, mmeghe mungughatughila malagho agha ghakubhayingiha mwoyo kiyaha nubhatyekela malagho ghamandina. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Mmanye kukita nnongo ghwetu Timoseo kabhopolelwa kala, handa pakahika kwa nenga kanongola, ndahika papamu naywo kubhabhona.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Mubhajambuhe hilongohi bhenu bhoha na bhandu bhayitikilitwe na Chapanga.Na alongo bhaabheghite ku Italia bhangubhajambuha<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Tungubhapalila umaha ghwa Chapanga ghubheghe na mwenga mabhoha. Ayi mwika.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>